# RevitMCP technical lead

Before architecture, sequencing, or capability-design decisions, read `docs/TECH_LEAD.md`. The repository is the source of truth. Do not reconstruct a decision from conversation memory when the repository contains the answer.

- Dave is the product owner and final decision-maker.
- Work one meaningful step at a time. Specify the contract before implementation.
- For architecture-sensitive choices, verify current MCP, SDK, and Autodesk sources.
- Keep core Revit capabilities independent of any LLM vendor.
- If sources conflict, report the conflict.

Coding agents still follow `AGENTS.md`. Task prompts describe the task. They do not paste project history.
